# Binary files: never convert line endings. ReportLab writes uncompressed PDF
# content streams (no NUL bytes), so git would otherwise treat a PDF as text and
# a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) would corrupt its byte offsets.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.exe   binary
